# Netlify Redirects Configuration
# Proxy /practice route to math-uploader search page

# Proxy all /practice requests to the deployed math-uploader app
# The :splat captures any path after /practice and forwards it
# Status 200! creates a proxy (doesn't change URL in browser)
/practice/*  https://jessychenmath-practice.netlify.app/search/:splat  200!
/practice    https://jessychenmath-practice.netlify.app/search         200!
